WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.724 --> 00:00:15.715
"I have to to Trends Department Store," Roxy thought.

2
00:00:16.455 --> 00:00:17.837
"Mannequins came to life!"

3
00:00:20.319 --> 00:00:21.399
She went back to her friends.

4
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:22.961
"I'll be right back.

5
00:00:23.701 --> 00:00:25.383
I'm going to get a drink of water."

6
00:00:26.243 --> 00:00:26.984
Roxy ran off.

7
00:00:27.004 --> 00:00:28.605
"Good luck!"

8
00:00:28.966 --> 00:00:29.666
Terrell called.

9
00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:31.648
Mara raised an eyebrow.

10
00:00:32.444 --> 00:00:34.605
"What does Roxy need good luck for?"

11
00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:38.967
"Oh, um Terrell bit his lip.

12
00:00:38.987 --> 00:00:42.808
"Maybe she'll have a hard time finding a water fountain."

13
00:00:45.490 --> 00:00:47.751
Roxy arrived outside Trends Department Store.

14
00:00:48.891 --> 00:00:50.492
Several people were hiding outside.

15
00:00:51.372 --> 00:00:52.172
They looked scared.

16
00:00:52.192 --> 00:00:55.154
"Rocket Girl!"

17
00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:56.114
a woman said.

18
00:00:56.134 --> 00:00:58.175
"I'm glad you're here.

19
00:00:58.835 --> 00:01:00.416
Mannequins are coming to life!"

20
00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:02.300
"I know."

21
00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:03.981
Roxy looked around.

22
00:01:04.001 --> 00:01:06.162
"Where are the mannequins?"

23
00:01:06.182 --> 00:01:08.963
"I don't know," a man said.

24
00:01:08.983 --> 00:01:12.404
"But they tried to make us wear ugly clothes!"

25
00:01:12.424 --> 00:01:16.806
"We fought them off," another woman said.

26
00:01:20.528 --> 00:01:22.528
Roxy found Detective Smith inside.

27
00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:24.769
He was standing in a clothing section.

28
00:01:29.671 --> 00:01:31.392
You're here," the detective said.

29
00:01:32.656 --> 00:01:35.078
"Ahh!" Roxy pretended to be scared.

30
00:01:35.098 --> 00:01:38.181
"That mannequin just talked!"

31
00:01:39.342 --> 00:01:40.563
Detective Smith frowned.

32
00:01:40.583 --> 00:01:44.206
"I'm not a mannequin, Rocket Girl."

33
00:01:44.887 --> 00:01:46.128
Roxy rolled her eyes.

34
00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:49.251
"I know that, Detective."

35
00:01:50.111 --> 00:01:50.892
She looked around.

36
00:01:50.912 --> 00:01:53.174
"Are the mannequins in here?

37
00:01:54.055 --> 00:01:55.676
Some people outside saw them."

38
00:01:55.696 --> 00:01:59.560
"I think the mannequins are gone," Detective Smith said.

39
00:02:00.892 --> 00:02:03.014
A woman peeked out from under a clothing rack.

40
00:02:03.034 --> 00:02:05.195
"Are they really gone?"

41
00:02:06.396 --> 00:02:07.497
Detective Smith jumped.

42
00:02:07.517 --> 00:02:09.919
"Oh! You scared me!

43
00:02:10.860 --> 00:02:11.880
Yes, they're gone."

44
00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.043
"Whew!" The woman crawled out from under the rack.

45
00:02:18.265 --> 00:02:19.346
She dusted herself off.

46
00:02:19.366 --> 00:02:21.908
"I was so scared!"

47
00:02:21.928 --> 00:02:23.869
"What happened here?"

48
00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:24.990
Roxy asked.

49
00:02:25.831 --> 00:02:26.972
The woman took a deep breath.

50
00:02:28.776 --> 00:02:31.177
"I was dressing mannequins in some new clothes.

51
00:02:32.358 --> 00:02:33.939
Suddenly they came to life.

52
00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:37.081
They tried to make me wear the clothes too.

53
00:02:38.482 --> 00:02:39.222
I refused.

54
00:02:40.723 --> 00:02:41.924
The clothes were too ugly."

55
00:02:44.065 --> 00:02:45.986
"What clothes are the mannequins wearing?"

56
00:02:46.246 --> 00:02:47.307
Detective Smith asked.

57
00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:50.628
The woman pointed to a rack of ugly clothes.

58
00:02:50.648 --> 00:02:53.430
"It's a new line of clothing."

59
00:02:55.711 --> 00:02:56.552
Roxy read a label.

60
00:02:57.968 --> 00:02:59.529
"'Viktor Velour'?"

61
00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:01.491
The woman nodded.

62
00:03:01.511 --> 00:03:03.513
"He's the designer.

63
00:03:04.213 --> 00:03:06.695
These clothes are all from his new line.

64
00:03:06.735 --> 00:03:08.817
They're absolutely horrible."

65
00:03:10.198 --> 00:03:10.779
She snorted.

66
00:03:10.799 --> 00:03:13.681
"I read an interview with Viktor.

67
00:03:14.342 --> 00:03:17.284
He said that everyone in the world will wear his clothes.

68
00:03:17.524 --> 00:03:19.226
I seriously doubt it!

69
00:03:19.746 --> 00:03:21.688
Nobody with good taste would wear them."

70
00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:26.832
Detective Smith pulled a scarf off the rack.

71
00:03:27.924 --> 00:03:28.885
It had wavy stripes.

72
00:03:28.906 --> 00:03:31.148
"I kind of like this."

73
00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.732
The detective put the scarf on.

74
00:03:35.794 --> 00:03:37.316
Suddenly his eyes went blank.

75
00:03:38.878 --> 00:03:39.940
"I look fabulous!

76
00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.043
From now on, I will only wear Viktor Velour's clothes!"
